really optimize any facet of your life without&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:57.040 --> 00:05:04.120
perhaps strategically deoptimizing or neglecting&nbsp;
other aspects. I think it's beyond the reach of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:04.120 --> 00:05:11.040
most mortals to optimize everything. So it becomes&nbsp;
a question of trade-offs and picking and choosing.&nbsp;

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:14.320
Question from Zain. "Who is someone&nbsp;
you've been impressed with lately&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:14.320 --> 00:05:19.000
that people may not know of, and why?"
