00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:29.560
oldie but a goodie. This is a Chinese photographer&nbsp;
named Fan Ho, incredible photographer director,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:29.560 --> 00:05:36.720
multihyphenate, long since passed, as I understand&nbsp;
