make a better decision at 80 percent. Well,&nbsp;
if it's very low-cost or reversible or both&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:40.520 --> 00:09:47.320
making a fast decision and approaching it in&nbsp;
more of a ready, fire, aim sequence, I think,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:47.320 --> 00:09:53.840
