love to know one of your favorite secret spots&nbsp;
in the country for a visit." All right. Here are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:47:27.960 --> 00:47:35.440
a couple of recommendations. And one will be not&nbsp;
so secret, but a lot of foreigners don't visit it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:47:35.440 --> 00:47:42.800
and that's the Ghibli Museum. They call it Mitaka&nbsp;
Forest, but it is basically in Inokashira Park,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:47:42.800 --> 00:47:47.720
Inokashira-koen. You can get the tickets,&nbsp;
or at least, you could at Lawson convenience&nbsp;&nbsp;

