their crowning achievement, but I'm biased. Ghibli&nbsp;
Museum. And Inokashira Park is also tremendous.&nbsp;

00:48:14.320 --> 00:48:24.480
I would say, if you drink, Gen Yamamoto, so G-E-N,&nbsp;
