helpful for cognition, for sustained energy,&nbsp;
for a million different things. And there are,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:07:16.120 --> 01:07:21.080
if you follow the letter of the law per&nbsp;
se, very few ways you can screw that up.&nbsp;

01:07:21.080 --> 01:07:25.000
With intermittent fasting there are a lot of ways&nbsp;
