01:07:31.120 --> 01:07:39.240
are a lot of ways you can screw it up. And if you&nbsp;
look at, for instance, what I wrote in The 4-Hour&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:07:39.240 --> 01:07:43.800
Chef and The 4-Hour Body, but especially in The&nbsp;
