01:07:43.800 --> 01:07:50.720
failure points, identifying the failure points and&nbsp;
removing as many failure points as possible. 30&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:07:50.720 --> 01:07:57.520
grams within 30 minutes of waking up avoids dozens&nbsp;
of different possible dietary failure points and&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:07:57.520 --> 01:08:04.120
body re-composition failure points as well. If&nbsp;
