meditators or in some people the very first&nbsp;
time they try a new type of meditation,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:10:20.560 --> 01:10:26.040
they will have this experience of vanishing.&nbsp;
Having the self vanish for a brief period of&nbsp;&nbsp;

