debated with him about these types of things.
If somebody gets in a car accident, suddenly&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:16:02.160 --> 01:16:06.400
they have back pain they never had before, maybe&nbsp;
it's the car accident and not just their emotional&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:16:06.400 --> 01:16:11.920
